            "review_title": "Review at Fireworks Raw - Grill & Craft Bar",
            "review_text": "Catherine S\nLondon, United Kingdom87 contributions\n0\nTasty food. Very pleasant dining experience.\nMar 2022 • Family\nVery pleasant dining experience. Pleasant surroundings, waitress was sweet & friendly and the food was really good. Decor was interesting with copies of famous paintings on the ceiling. Expensive restaurant for Ho Chi Minh but matched the quality of the experience.\n\nHad the grilled fresh figs, seared foie gras, smoked duck bouquet garnish, raspberry dressing for starter. All the flavours worked well together. Then the chilli salt sea prawn in foil green mango asian herb and green spicy sauce for main. Prawns were really tasty and the sauce was hot but nice. Mushrooms for a side dish. Would recommend all of my dishes.\nRead more\nWritten March 30, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
